OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'did not see' partner drive
OL,4,Aher car into crowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose partner drove a car into
OL,7,Fa group of people after a row outside a
OL,8,Fbar said she did not see the incident.
OL,10,FNottingham Crown Court has heard a
OL,11,Fnumber of people were injured when a
OL,12,Fvehicle hit a group on Gedling Road in
OL,13,FArnold on 9 May, with 26-year-old Tyler
OL,14,FFairman dying from his injuries three
OL,15,Fdays later.
OL,17,FDestiny Carrier, who owned the car,
OL,18,Fsaid she believed her partner Duane
OL,19,FAnthony had been involved in "an
OL,20,Faccident".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
