OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'did not see' partner drive
OL,4,Aher car into crowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 29-year-old, of Lothair Road in
OL,7,FLeicester, denies assisting an
OL,8,Foffender, while 40-year-old Anthony, of
OL,9,FMarton Road in Bulwell, has denied
OL,10,Fmurdering Fairman and five counts of
OL,11,Fattempted murder.
